<div class="layout">

```
<%- include("../partials/sidebar") %>

<main class="main-content">

    <div class="page-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">PROFILE & PERSONALIZATION</p>
        <h1>Make your profile yours ✨</h1>
        <p>
            Personalize your profile and let the SocialSphere community
            know a little more about you.
        </p>
    </div>

    <form
        action="/users/<%= user.username %>/edit"
        method="POST"
        class="create-post-form"
    >

        <div class="profile-preview">
            <img
                src="<%= user.avatar || '/images/default-avatar.png' %>"
                alt="Profile picture"
            >

            <div>
                <strong>@<%= user.username %></strong>
                <p>Your SocialSphere profile</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-pen"></i>
                About You
            </label>

            <textarea
                name="bio"
                maxlength="300"
                placeholder="Share something interesting about yourself..."
            ><%= user.bio || "" %></textarea>

            <small>
                Introduce yourself in a few words. Maximum 300 characters.
            </small>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-image"></i>
                Profile Picture
            </label>

            <input
                type="url"
                name="avatar"
                value="<%= user.avatar || "" %>"
                placeholder="Paste your profile image URL..."
            >

            <small>
                Use a clear image URL to personalize your profile.
            </small>
        </div>

        <button
            type="submit"
            class="publish-btn"
        >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
            Update Profile
        </button>

    </form>

</main>
```

